<nt = 'http://www.jcp.org/jcr/nt/1.0'>
<mix = 'http://www.jcp.org/jcr/mix/1.0'>
<jnt = 'http://www.jahia.org/jahia/nt/1.0'>
<fmdbmix = 'http://www.jahia.org/jahia/fmdb/mix/1.0'>
<fmdbeff = 'http://www.jahia.org/jahia/fmdbeff/nt/1.0'>

// Creates an Efficy e-deal Opportunity from the submitted form values.
// The Efficy connection (server, application context, API token, field catalog) lives in operator
// configuration (org.jahia.modules.formidable.efficy-<id>.cfg); JCR only holds its id.
// fieldMapping is a JSON document authored by the EfficyOpportunityMapping selector type.
[fmdbeff:createOpportunityAction] > jnt:content, fmdbmix:formAction, fmdbmix:readOnlyCompatibleAction, mix:title
 - jcr:title (string) = resourceBundle('fmdbeff_createOpportunityAction') autocreated i18n
 - connectionId (string, choicelist[formidableEfficyConnections]) mandatory indexed=no
 - fieldMapping (string) indexed=no
 - failSubmissionOnError (boolean) = true autocreated indexed=no
